Description: Cin-MinAI assistant (the daemon)
 The assistant built into Cin-MinAI: it answers on the session bus as
 org.cinminai.Assistant1 for the sidebar, the panel applet and the other parts,
 and runs the model on this computer with llama.cpp (cinminai-llama). It picks
 the graphics card or the processor at each start, keeps graphics memory free
